			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"古爾根",
					"瓦爾坦"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230230101,
					"content": "這樣下去可不行啊，爸，薔薇的長勢實在不行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230102,
					"content": "得趕快想想辦法，不然今年我們就無法按時交付所有草藥了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230103,
					"content": "土壤沒問題，雜草和害蟲也都除了，這到底是怎麼回事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230104,
					"content": "你們在煩惱什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230105,
					"content": "#嗯？{F#妳}{M#你}是來購買草藥的客人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230106,
					"content": "事情是這樣的，每隔一段時間，我們都會向「健康之家」提供一批草藥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230107,
					"content": "其中最重要的就是這株特別的「須彌薔薇」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230108,
					"content": "原來薔薇也可以入藥嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230109,
					"content": "這就要問「健康之家」的醫生們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230110,
					"content": "反正他們說，這種薔薇和其他藥物搭配後可以治療中暑，對胃病也有緩解的效果，還有一些其他的功效…我也記不清楚了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230111,
						230230113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230111,
					"content": "既然如此，我會幫忙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230112,
					"content": "真是太感謝了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230113,
					"content": "這一株薔薇怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230114,
					"content": "不知道怎麼回事，這株薔薇生長得很緩慢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230115,
					"content": "按照我們以往的經驗，出現這種情況，要嘛是土壤出了問題，要嘛就是有蟲害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230116,
					"content": "不過，我們之前剛用這種土壤種了一批草藥，那批草藥的長勢可好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230117,
					"content": "我們每天都會除蟲，更不可能有蟲害…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230118,
					"content": "唉，不過現在也不能糾結這種問題，再拖下去，這一株薔薇就不能按時交給「健康之家」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古爾根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230119,
					"content": "所以我們計劃，總之先用特製的肥料給土壤增肥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230120,
					"content": "但我們兩個人還要去打理其他藥田，根本沒空再去搜集製作肥料所需的材料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230121,
					"content": "#旅行者，就算是為了「健康之家」的病人們…可以請{F#妳}{M#你}幫我們這個忙嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230122,
					"content": "我會幫忙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230123,
					"content": "真是太感謝了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230124,
					"content": "讓我看看現在的情況…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦爾坦"
				}
			]
		},
